<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Destec started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Destec started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it started coverage of Destec Energy Inc with a buy &quot;to reflect our view that the company will be sold in the next few months at a price of $16-20 per share.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock rose one to 14-5/8.</p>
<p>-- On Tuesday, the independent power producer said it retained an investment banking firm to explore strategic alternatives, including a possible sale of the company.</p>
</text>
